- Video lists now choose their layout based on screen size. The "List view mode" setting was removed and is cleared on upgrade.
- All images shown right after a loading shimmer are now precached
- All images are now guarded against invalid or empty URLs and show a scaled error icon instead of failing
- Plugin info dialogs now show only the plugin name as title

- Removed (barely implemented) in-app functionality tests from the third-party plugin install process
- Third-party plugin updates are now atomic
- Improved cleanup after a failed plugin import
- The plugin install file picker now only allows selecting a single zip file

- Removed `runFunctionalityTest` and `cancelGetProgressThumbnails` from the plugin interface
- Made the `plugin` field optional in universal formats
- Missing required fields are now handled in the `UniversalFormat` constructors instead of at plugin level
- Thumbnail download errors are now handled app-side instead of in plugins
- Aligned the internal tester plugin with the external example plugins

- Single failing list element or partial scrape no longer fails the whole plugin call in bundled plugins
- Scraping exceptions now include the element's HTML in bundled plugins
- Fixed pornhub crashing on invalid `previewVideo` URLs

- Fixed copying a video link on Desktop
- Fixed invalid images being downloaded into the database
- Fixed the changelog in the update dialog not being scrollable

- All `dart:io` network traffic is now routed through rhttp, which makes scraped data load more consistently and prepares for app-wide proxy support
- Switched rhttp to a fork (codeberg.org/Hedon-dev/rhttp) with a fixed `dart:io` shim (`IoCompatibleClient`)
- Video streams and previews now receive the default HTTP headers along with plugin overrides, and headers are matched case-insensitively

**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Hedon-Haven/Hedon-Haven/compare/v0.6.8...v0.6.9
